    {
      "id": "Kclp",
      "code_hash": "2abba53c5bf7a78a43360bb67ed2b313",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"4-construcao-incremental-regra-r9\">4. Constru\u00e7\u00e3o Incremental (Regra R9)</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>A nossa ideia:</strong> Se um professor ficar doente a meio do ano, n\u00e3o podemos deitar o hor\u00e1rio todo da escola para o lixo e refazer do zero (isso seria um caos para os alunos). O que fizemos foi ler os dados novos (<code>dados_v2</code>) e usar o hor\u00e1rio antigo como uma pista/palpite (<em>Warm-Start</em>). Dissemos ao solver: \"tenta arranjar a confus\u00e3o alterando o m\u00ednimo de aulas poss\u00edvel\".\nNesta parte foi utilizado o auxilio de um LLM</span></span><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"comparacao-de-desempenho\">Compara\u00e7\u00e3o de Desempenho</h3></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='RGSE-0' random-id='c9199475-ef83-03fc-db2b-a57d23de7fed'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;_marimo_row_id&#92;&quot;:0,&#92;&quot;Estrat&#92;&#92;u00e9gia&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Resolver do Zero (Mau)&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Tempo (s)&#92;&quot;:0.5265,&#92;&quot;Aulas Alteradas&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;M&#92;&#92;u00e1ximas (Sem Controlo)&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;_marimo_row_id&#92;&quot;:1,&#92;&quot;Estrat&#92;&#92;u00e9gia&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Usar a Solu&#92;&#92;u00e7&#92;&#92;u00e3o Antiga (Bom)&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Tempo (s)&#92;&quot;:0.4033,&#92;&quot;Aulas Alteradas&#92;&quot;:0}]&quot;' data-total-rows='2' data-total-columns='3' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-field-types='[[&quot;Estrat\u00e9gia&quot;,[&quot;string&quot;,&quot;str&quot;]],[&quot;Tempo (s)&quot;,[&quot;number&quot;,&quot;float64&quot;]],[&quot;Aulas Alteradas&quot;,[&quot;string&qu